OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F357A1786645112
OL,3,CBlind patient dropped by GP after
OL,4,Csocial post left 'in disbelief'
OL,6,FA Jersey resident says he has been
OL,7,Fleft "shocked" and "in disbelief"
OL,8,Fafter his GP surgery decided to remove
OL,9,Fhim as a patient.
OL,11,FJoshua Collis, who is legally blind,
OL,12,Frelies on repeat prescriptions to
OL,13,Fmanage chronic pain and to help him
OL,14,Fsleep.
OL,16,FHe took to social media to complain
OL,17,Fabout First Medical following what he
OL,18,Fclaims are persistent issues with
OL,19,Ftheir service.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G1/6
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
