FL,358,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F357A1786645112
OL,3,CBlind patient dropped by GP after
OL,4,Csocial post left 'in disbelief'
OL,6,FIn the post on a local Facebook group,
OL,7,FJoshua wrote: "Every single time I've
OL,8,Fgone to renew my prescription for
OL,9,Fnearly a year now, they have made it
OL,10,Fso painful and difficult to collect my
OL,11,Fmedication.
OL,13,F"It's a new issue every time. I order
OL,14,Fmy repeat in the app and specify the
OL,15,Fpharmacy for collection every time...
OL,16,Fand every single time they have failed
OL,17,Fto send my prescription through with
OL,18,Fvarious excuses."
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G2/6
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,358,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F357A1786645112
OL,3,CBlind patient dropped by GP after
OL,4,Csocial post left 'in disbelief'
OL,6,FHe also asked for recommendations if
OL,7,Fhe was to transfer GP practices and
OL,8,Fwithin hours, Joshua says that
OL,9,Fdecision was taken out of his hands as
OL,10,Fhe was dropped by First Medical.
OL,12,FHe explains: "I just literally that
OL,13,Fmorning got a notification that 'your
OL,14,Faccount is closed'.
OL,16,F"I checked in the app and couldn't
OL,17,Faccess my prescriptions anymore,
OL,18,Fcouldn't see my history or anything
OL,19,Flike that."
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G3/6
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,358,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F357A1786645112
OL,3,CBlind patient dropped by GP after
OL,4,Csocial post left 'in disbelief'
OL,6,FJoshua was given a month's supply of
OL,7,Fmedication and sent a letter by the
OL,8,FDirectors at First Medical, stating
OL,9,Fthat he had been removed from their
OL,10,Fpractice's patient list "with
OL,11,Fimmediate effect".
OL,13,FIt says: "We were disappointed to
OL,14,Flearn of your dissatisfaction with the
OL,15,Fprescription service you received
OL,16,Fyesterday, and to see your concerns
OL,17,Fexpressed on local social media.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G4/6
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,358,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F357A1786645112
OL,3,CBlind patient dropped by GP after
OL,4,Csocial post left 'in disbelief'
OL,6,F"We recognise that there are occasions
OL,7,Fwhen our processes require review or
OL,8,Fimprovement and we genuinely welcome
OL,9,Fconstructive feedback.
OL,11,F"However, the public nature and one-
OL,12,Fsided criticism of the practice on
OL,13,Flocal social media has resulted in a
OL,14,Fbreakdown of the relationship between
OL,15,Fyourself and First Medical, and we
OL,16,Fhave made the decision to remove you
OL,17,Ffrom our practice list with immediate
OL,18,Feffect."
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G5/6
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,358,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35706
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F357A1786645112
OL,3,CBlind patient dropped by GP after
OL,4,Csocial post left 'in disbelief'
OL,6,FThe letter continues that Joshua's
OL,7,Fmedical records will be transferred to
OL,8,Fhis new GP once he is registered with
OL,9,Fthem and adds: "We wish you well for
OL,10,Fthe future".
OL,12,FHowever, Joshua believes the action
OL,13,Ftaken is "extremely disproportionate
OL,14,Fand retaliatory".
OL,16,FITV Channel contacted First Medical
OL,17,Fwho said they could not comment due to
OL,18,F"patient confidentiality reasons ...
OL,19,Fwhile we are continuing to attempt to
OL,20,Fresolve the matter".
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G6/6
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
